# Build context for the exporter image.
#
# The image needs exactly two things from the package: package.json and src/. Everything
# else is excluded, including the package's tests, the chart, the e2e harness and the
# tooling — so excluding `packages` wholesale is not an option.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/coverage
.tools
.github
tools
docs
e2e
charts
model
openspec
*.md
*.tgz
packages/cube-prometheus/test
